---

<section id="workflow" class="py-24 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 mb-3">Operating Lifecycle</h2>
      <p class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white font-heading tracking-tight">
        From Ingestion to Syndicate in 4 Steps
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300">
        How LIFT compresses typical 60-day institutional diligence cycles into 7 business days with continuous verification.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 relative">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/30 transition-all relative group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 font-bold font-mono flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-indigo-500/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          01
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Multi-Format Ingestion</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Founders upload financial models, MCA certificates, audits, and board resolutions into an encrypted vault with OCR indexing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all relative group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 font-bold font-mono flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-purple-500/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          02
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Automated Audit & AI Flags</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Proprietary rules engines parse consistency across tax filings, MCA filings, shareholding registries, and non-standard covenants.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-all relative group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 font-bold font-mono flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-blue-500/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          03
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">Incubator Pipeline Review</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Partner incubators track readiness scores, trigger remediation tasks, and ensure compliance with institutional grant mandates.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all relative group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 font-bold font-mono flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-emerald-500/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          04
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-heading mb-2">IC Memo & Deal Closing</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          GGAM Advisory exports investment committee dossiers with full evidentiary trails for capital deployment and syndicate syndication.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
